OL,3,GNEWSAAttempt to quash asylum housing
OL,4,Aplans over safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn opposition attempt to halt
OL,7,Fgovernment plans to house more than
OL,8,F1,200 asylum seekers at a former
OL,9,FMinistry of Defence site has failed.
OL,11,FThe Conservatives tabled the motion to
OL,12,Fend government plans to house 1,256
OL,13,Fmale asylum seekers at MoD Bicester in
OL,14,Fthe House of Commons on Wednesday.
OL,16,FProposing that the UK leaves the
OL,17,FEuropean Convention on Human Rights
OL,18,F(ECHR), shadow Minister for women and
OL,19,Fequalities Joy Morrisey said
OL,20,Fcommunities were "suffering".
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
