OL,3,GNEWSAAttempt to quash asylum housing
OL,4,Aplans over safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the government said similar sites
OL,7,Fto that at Bicester had operated "for
OL,8,Fyears" with "no evidence of any
OL,9,Fsignificant increase in criminality".
